\\n      >\\n        Cancel\\n      </Link>\\n      {children}\\n      <Button type=\\\"submit\\\" disabled={isPending}>\\n        {isPending && pendingLabel ? pendingLabel : submitLabel}\\n      </Button>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n```\\n\\nEach form would then replace its duplicated bottom `<div>` with:\\n\\n```tsx\\n<InvoiceFormActions\\n  cancelHref=\\\"/dashboard/invoices\\\"\\n  submitLabel=\\\"Create Invoice\\\"\\n/>\\n```\\n\\nor:\\n\\n```tsx\\n<InvoiceFormActions\\n  cancelHref=\\\"/dashboard/invoices\\\"\\n  submitLabel=\\\"Edit Invoice\\\"\\n/>\\n```\\n\\nThat keeps the layout, cancel styling, spacing, and submit-button behavior in one place while preserving the create/edit-specific label as the only required variation.\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":56313,\"cached_input_tokens\":12160,\"output_tokens\":635,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":88}}\n",
